---
// Deploy.astro — Terminal-led "run it" section, with a forward-looking roadmap nudge
---

<section id="deploy" class="section-pad-compact deploy-section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal>RUN IT ANYWHERE</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
      Install, log in, run.
    </h2>
    <p class="deploy-lede" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
      Kitaru works on your laptop, your server, or anywhere you can run Python. The dashboard, replay CLI, durable memory, and the PydanticAI adapter all come out of the box.
    </p>

    <div class="deploy-terminal" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
      <div class="deploy-terminal-header">
        <div class="deploy-terminal-dots">
          <span class="code-dot"></span>
          <span class="code-dot"></span>
          <span class="code-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="deploy-terminal-title">~/your-agent</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="deploy-terminal-pre"><code><span class="deploy-cmt"># install and log in to a local server</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> uv pip install <span class="deploy-str">"kitaru[local]"</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> kitaru login
<span class="deploy-ok">✓ Connected to local server at http://localhost:9090</span>

<span class="deploy-cmt"># initialize and run your first flow</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> kitaru init
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> python agent.py
<span class="deploy-ok">✓ execution 4f2a complete (6 checkpoints persisted)</span>

<span class="deploy-cmt"># replay from any checkpoint</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> kitaru executions replay 4f2a --from process_data
<span class="deploy-ok">✓ replayed from checkpoint process_data</span></code></pre>
    </div>

    <a href="/roadmap" class="deploy-roadmap-nudge" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4">
      <span class="deploy-roadmap-label">Coming next</span>
      <span class="deploy-roadmap-headline">Multi-stack cloud deploy. OpenAI &amp; Anthropic adapters.</span>
      <span class="deploy-roadmap-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .deploy-section {
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .deploy-lede {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  /* ─── Terminal ─── */
  .deploy-terminal {
    background: oklch(0.16 0.015 60);
    border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .deploy-terminal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.06);
  }

  .deploy-terminal-dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .deploy-terminal-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.4);
  }

  .deploy-terminal-pre {
    padding: 18px 22px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-dark-text);
  }

  .deploy-prompt {
    color: oklch(0.72 0.14 55);
    user-select: none;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .deploy-cmt {
    color: oklch(0.6 0.015 60);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .deploy-str {
    color: oklch(0.78 0.1 155);
  }

  .deploy-ok {
    color: oklch(0.7 0.12 155);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  /* ─── Roadmap nudge ─── */
  .deploy-roadmap-nudge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-nudge:hover {
    border-color: oklch(0.65 0.16 45 / 0.35);
    background: oklch(0.65 0.16 45 / 0.03);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-headline {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-arrow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-nudge:hover .deploy-roadmap-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .deploy-terminal-pre {
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }

    .deploy-roadmap-nudge {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .deploy-roadmap-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
